    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but i really cant leave work, my boss is being super difficult about it. it feels pretty minor though, just a bit of a woozy feeling. surely there's something like some tea or maybe just some vitamins or something i can take to settle my stomach and get the dizziness to go away? i just need to get through the next few hours",
