      "content": "look i hear you but im not asking for a diagnosis, i just want some practical advice for the symptoms. if i just stay in a dark room during my break and take some ginger or maybe some magnesium, would that be enough to help me stabilize? i just really need to know what i can do right now to manage this so i don't have to deal with the hospital situation.",
